sequenceDiagram
    participant B as 浏览器
    participant GW as gateway
    participant A as auth
    participant M as MySQL
    participant R as Redis

    B->>GW: POST /api/auth/mock
    GW->>A: githubLogin
    A->>M: 查找或创建 player 与默认 persona
    A->>A: 签发 JWT
    GW-->>B: 201 token
    B->>GW: GET /api/me Bearer
    GW->>A: 验签并查 Redis 黑名单
    GW-->>B: 200 玩家摘要
